{
  "name": "item-frames",
  "normalizations": [
    "Compare item frames hung on a wall and on the floor, a diamond put in one and turned twice, knocked out by a hit, and the empty frame broken by another, their drops picked up, and a comparator reading a frame beyond the block behind it.",
    "Entity IDs and UUIDs are left out; dropped items' random motion is not compared, only the inventory after their pickup.",
    "Use matching flat terrain."
